window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"cassiopeia","b":"masteryi","win":["Cassiopeia","Cassiopeia","Cassiopeia","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Cassiopeia"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"The E poison-heal loop comes online — you chunk him and heal back his scratch damage at the same time."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows — Miasma's slow does nothing, but its grounding still kills Alpha Strike."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Wuju Style's true damage kills you if he connects — ground Alpha Strike or hold Gaze for his face."},{"when":"Late","text":"Gaze's stun still lands through Highlander — a stunned Yi melts inside two seconds of ramped Twin Fang."}],"wants":{"you":["Poison poke every wave","Miasma grounds Alpha Strike","Gaze cancels his Meditate"],"foe":["Farm safely to 6","Q-dash around your Gaze","Kill you before R comes up"]},"early":"Bully him hard. Your Q out-pokes his melee frame at 1, the W slow-zone denies his level 2 engage outright, and from 3 the E poison-heal loop chunks him while healing back his scratch damage. Zone him off CS, stack your lead, and force him to farm under tower where your Q lands free.","mid":"By 4 his Wuju points even it, and at 6 the lane turns: Highlander (85s) makes him slow-immune, so Miasma's slow reads as nothing — the grounding still blocks his 20s Alpha Strike. At first item his true damage kills you if he connects. Hold Gaze for his commit — a face-on Yi is a stunned Yi. Never show your back.","late":"Your R and zone control retake the matchup late: the cone stun cancels a Meditate channel outright, grounded Miasma still blanks Alpha Strike through Highlander, and ramped Twin Fang melts him inside two seconds of lockdown. Fight near your team and make him choose between eating Gaze face-first or not fighting.","whys":["Cassiopeia owns level 1 — your Q out-pokes a melee Yi who has no way to answer at range.","Level 2 stays yours: the W slow-zone denies his engage entirely, so he can't even start the trade he wants.","Level 3 is yours — E poison-heal spam chunks him down while sustaining you through his scratch damage.","By 4 his Wuju Style points bring the lane to even — trades are honest now, so lean on spacing, not stats.","Master Yi takes 6: Highlander's 85s of slow immunity blanks Miasma's slow and Alpha Strike dodges spells. Gaze still stuns — save it for his commit.","First item is his — Wuju true damage out-DPSes you if he sticks. Ground the 20s Alpha Strike, or Gaze him face-on.","Late is Cassiopeia's: Gaze's stun beats Highlander, W's grounding still blanks Alpha Strike, and a locked-down Yi melts in seconds."]});
